#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"Traefik is restarted afterwards. It only reads acme.json at startup, so "
"without that the change would be undone."
msgstr ""
"Traefik se poté restartuje. Soubor acme.json čte jen při spuštění, takže bez "
"toho by se změna vrátila."

