#, python-format
msgid ""
"Traefik strips these from the right of %(x_forwarded_for)s and uses the next "
"IP. Use when the proxy's own IPs vary. Cannot be combined with a fixed depth."
msgstr ""
"Traefik tyto adresy odebere zprava z %(x_forwarded_for)s a použije další IP. "
"Použijte, když se IP adresy samotné proxy mění. Nelze kombinovat s pevnou "
"hloubkou."

